BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-upkeep@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261012T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:KINZ · Upkeep — CI\, dependencies\, merges
DESCRIPTION:Daily sweep of every Kinz-org repo in the registry (not the vau
 lt\, not loop-engine-state).\n• Merges green Dependabot updates\; asks D
 ependabot to rebase conflicted ones\, closes them after two tries.\n• Ta
 kes over agent PRs (claude/loop-…): merges them when CI is green\, resol
 ves conflicts\, fixes red CI (two attempts\, then closes PRs older than 7 
 days).\n• Fixes a red default branch when the cause is clear\; adds a pu
 ll-request CI workflow to a repo that has none.\n• Accounting repo: neve
 r merges a change to how a reported figure is derived — labels it 'hold'
  for you.\nMerge rules: CI ran and passed\, no workflow file edited\, no t
 est weakened.\nOutput: merged PRs\, a run record in runs/\, one status lin
 e on your phone.\n\nWhen: 45 1 * * * (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: clau
 de.ai routine.\nOpens PRs: yes. Merges: yes.\nJob id: kinz-upkeep.\nInstru
 ctions: github.com/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/maintenanc
 e.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-market-watch@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261013T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:KINZ · Market watch — competitor data check
DESCRIPTION:Read-only check of the weekly competitor scrape\, the night aft
 er Monday's GitHub Actions run.\n• Downloads competitors.db from the 'we
 ekly-scrape-data' release of kinz-competitor-intelligence.\n• Counts com
 petitors\, products and price history\; finds competitors the scrape misse
 d\, suspicious prices (zeros\, identical clusters)\, the 100-product pagin
 ation bug\, and price moves over 30%.\n• Never prints contact names\, ph
 ones or emails\; deletes the database at the end.\nChanges nothing in the 
 repo. Output: a new dated section in findings/kci-data-quality.md.\n\nWhen
 : 45 1 * * 2 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai routine.\nOpens PR
 s: no. Merges: no.\nJob id: kinz-market-watch.\nInstructions: github.com/K
 inz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/kinz-analyst.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-polish@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261012T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,WE,FR
SUMMARY:KINZ · Polish — improvements on two repos
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, Wednesday and Friday: real improvements on the next tw
 o repos of the rotation.\n• Reads each repo's docs/IMPROVEMENTS.md and r
 efills it to 3–5 items found in the code when it runs low.\n• Fixes th
 e top open item on its own branch\, with a regression test for every bug\,
  and ticks it off in the same PR.\n• Merges when CI is green\; money\, t
 ax and reported-figure logic goes to an Opus subagent with tests that pin 
 the numbers.\nOutput: up to two merged PRs\, rotation cursor moved\, notes
  for future runs in registry.json.\n\nWhen: 45 1 * * 1\,3\,5 (cron\, Afric
 a/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai routine.\nOpens PRs: yes. Merges: yes.\nJob 
 id: kinz-polish.\nInstructions: github.com/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob
 /main/prompts/improvements.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-ledger@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261013T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU,TU,TH
SUMMARY:KINZ · Ledger — accounting repo fixes
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, Tuesday and Thursday: 1 to 3 tested fixes in kinz-acco
 unting-analysis.\n• Runs pytest\, ruff and the read-only verifier\; rebu
 ilds reports offline from the committed extract (never calls Odoo).\n• L
 ooks for wrong maths\, dead code paths\, reports that contradict their dat
 a\, stale docs\, missing tests.\n• Tax and money reasoning goes to an Op
 us subagent. A change to a reported figure is left open with the 'hold' la
 bel and a NEEDS YOU alert.\nOutput: merged test/doc/fix PRs\, held figure 
 changes for you.\n\nWhen: 45 1 * * 0\,2\,4 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on
 : claude.ai routine.\nOpens PRs: yes. Merges: yes.\nJob id: kinz-ledger.\n
 Instructions: github.com/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/kinz
 -accounting.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-lab@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261017T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
SUMMARY:KINZ · Lab — weekly creative experiment
DESCRIPTION:Saturday: one new idea in one rotation repo\, judged by an inde
 pendent agent.\n• Picks a repo (not last week's)\, chooses an idea that 
 fits one PR\, and writes 3–6 success checks in experiments/ before writi
 ng code.\n• Builds it with tests\, then a fresh Opus judge runs every ch
 eck and answers VERIFIED or NOT VERIFIED.\n• Merged only if VERIFIED and
  CI is green\; one retry with a new judge\, otherwise closed with the verd
 ict.\nOutput: the experiment file with its verdict\, and the PR.\n\nWhen: 
 45 1 * * 6 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai routine.\nOpens PRs:
  yes. Merges: yes.\nJob id: kinz-lab.\nInstructions: github.com/Kinz-org/l
 oop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/creative.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-heartbeat@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261012T064500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:KINZ · Heartbeat — one small fix if the day is empty
DESCRIPTION:Every morning at 06:45\, after the night jobs.\n• If anything
  already landed today on a Kinz-org repo\, it stops (status: skipped).\n
 • Otherwise makes one small\, real fix in the least recently updated rot
 ation repo: an open improvement item\, a wrong doc line\, a missing test.\
 n• No whitespace churn\, no renames for their own sake. Merged when CI i
 s green.\nOutput: at most one merged PR\, so the contribution graph shows 
 real work every day.\n\nWhen: 45 6 * * * (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: 
 claude.ai routine.\nOpens PRs: yes. Merges: yes.\nJob id: kinz-heartbeat.\
 nInstructions: github.com/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/dai
 ly-commit.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
