DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261012T064500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:KINZ · Monday digest — the week in one page
DESCRIPTION:Monday 06:45: the weekly report you read on your phone.\n• Sh
 ipped: merged PRs per repo\, with links.\n• Broken or stuck: red CI\, PR
 s left open\, failures.\n• Jobs that did not run: compares each job's sc
 hedule with its run records\; 'missing' means it never fired.\n• The Lab
  verdict\, next week's rotation\, and repos not attached to the routine (N
 EEDS YOU).\nChanges no work repo. Output: reports/weekly-<year>-W<week>.md
 .\n\nWhen: 45 6 * * 1 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai routine.\
 nOpens PRs: no. Merges: no.\nJob id: kinz-digest.\nInstructions: github.co
 m/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/weekly-summary.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kinz-portfolio@loop-engine-state.kinz-org
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Tunis:20261018T014500
DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:KINZ · Portfolio review — three public repos
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 01:45: the github-portfolio-builder method\, applied to 
 the three public repos reviewed longest ago.\n• Reads each README and ch
 ecks its claims against the code: links\, badges\, quick-start commands\, 
 license.\n• Labels every finding verified\, reported or unresolved\; at 
 most five per repo.\n• Fixes and merges only small checkable things (wro
 ng links\, wrong badges\, commands that don't match the code\, README line
 s the code contradicts).\n• Licenses\, visibility\, descriptions\, claim
 s about results and workflows are left to you\, listed under 'Needs the ow
 ner'.\nOutput: reports/portfolio-<year>-W<week>.md and the merged PRs.\n\n
 When: 45 1 * * 0 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai routine.\nOpen
 s PRs: yes. Merges: yes.\nJob id: kinz-portfolio.\nInstructions: github.co
 m/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/portfolio.md
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
