DURATION:PT30M
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:KINZ · Vault gardener — Obsidian weekly pass
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 06:45\, after the portfolio review: a gardening pass on 
 the Obsidian vault\, in French\, in the vault's own style.\n• Adds a mis
 sing 'type' to notes\, links orphan notes from their hub\, refreshes the A
 tlas 'Pistes à écrire' table\, rebuilds the 3D planets view.\n• Writes
  'Journal des boucles — <year>-W<week>': every job of the week\, its run
 s\, merged PRs and open NEEDS YOU items.\n• Never moves\, renames or del
 etes a note\; never touches .obsidian/ or Templates/\; grey links stay —
  they are leads.\n• Opens one PR and does NOT merge it: you review it in
  Obsidian\, then merge.\nOutput: a vault PR and a NEEDS YOU alert with its
  link.\n\nWhen: 45 6 * * 0 (cron\, Africa/Tunis).\nRuns on: claude.ai rout
 ine.\nOpens PRs: yes. Merges: no.\nJob id: kinz-vault.\nInstructions: gith
 ub.com/Kinz-org/loop-engine-state/blob/main/prompts/vault-gardener.md
